        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks have transformed precision timekeeping and enable qualitatively new measurements of gravity, fundamental constants, and relativistic time.",
        "attribution": "Katori originated the lattice-clock concept and its magic-wavelength implementation; Ye made decisive experimental advances toward practical record-performance clocks.",
        "maturity": "The technique is reproduced internationally, has reached extraordinary accuracy, and is becoming a usable metrological standard.",
