        "David Huang",
        "Eric A. Swanson",
        "James G. Fujimoto"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical coherence tomography created a major non-invasive imaging modality, with exceptionally broad clinical and scientific impact from a clear physical principle.",
        "attribution": "Huang, Swanson, and Fujimoto are directly associated with the foundational demonstration and development of OCT.",
        "maturity": "Its performance, applications, and reproducibility are established through decades of widespread clinical use.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Later engineering improvements involved a large community, though the foundational attribution is unusually clear."
        ]
      }
    },
